---
/** Simplified retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) flow for the CRM assistant. */
---

<figure class="diagram mt-6">
  <p class="mb-2 text-xs text-muted md:hidden" aria-hidden="true">Swipe to see the full diagram →</p>
  <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-4 md:p-6" tabindex="0" aria-label="AI assistant answer flow diagram (scrollable)">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 880 300" class="min-w-[720px]" role="img" aria-labelledby="rag-title rag-desc">
      <title id="rag-title">AI assistant answer flow (RAG)</title>
      <desc id="rag-desc">
        A question from the CRM chat goes to the ASP.NET Core API. The API retrieves relevant company data from Azure
        AI Search, sends the question with that context to Azure OpenAI, and returns a grounded answer to the CRM.
      </desc>
      <defs>
        <marker id="rag-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M0 0 10 5 0 10z" fill="var(--primary)"></path>
        </marker>
        <marker id="rag-arrow-alt" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M0 0 10 5 0 10z" fill="var(--accent-ink)"></path>
        </marker>
      </defs>

      <rect class="node" x="16" y="116" width="170" height="68" rx="14"></rect>
      <text class="t-title" x="101" y="146" text-anchor="middle">Question</text>
      <text class="t-sub" x="101" y="166" text-anchor="middle">CRM chat · Angular</text>

      <rect class="node node-accent" x="300" y="116" width="200" height="68" rx="14"></rect>
      <text class="t-title" x="400" y="146" text-anchor="middle">ASP.NET Core API</text>
      <text class="t-sub" x="400" y="166" text-anchor="middle">orchestrates the flow</text>

      <rect class="node" x="640" y="24" width="224" height="68" rx="14"></rect>
      <text class="t-title" x="752" y="54" text-anchor="middle">Azure AI Search</text>
      <text class="t-sub" x="752" y="74" text-anchor="middle">finds relevant company data</text>

      <rect class="node" x="640" y="208" width="224" height="68" rx="14"></rect>
      <text class="t-title" x="752" y="238" text-anchor="middle">Azure OpenAI</text>
      <text class="t-sub" x="752" y="258" text-anchor="middle">writes a grounded answer</text>

      <path class="edge" d="M186 140H298" marker-end="url(#rag-arrow)"></path>
      <text class="t-label" x="242" y="130" text-anchor="middle">ask</text>

      <path class="edge" d="M500 128 638 66" marker-end="url(#rag-arrow)"></path>
      <text class="t-label" x="548" y="82" text-anchor="middle">① retrieve</text>
      <path class="edge-dashed" d="M640 82 512 138" marker-end="url(#rag-arrow-alt)"></path>

      <path class="edge" d="M500 172 638 232" marker-end="url(#rag-arrow)"></path>
      <text class="t-label" x="545" y="232" text-anchor="middle">② question + context</text>
      <path class="edge-dashed" d="M640 250 512 194" marker-end="url(#rag-arrow-alt)"></path>

      <path class="edge-dashed" d="M300 164H188" marker-end="url(#rag-arrow-alt)"></path>
      <text class="t-label" x="244" y="186" text-anchor="middle">③ answer</text>

      <circle class="packet" r="5">
        <animateMotion dur="3.6s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M186 140H298M500 128 638 66M500 172 638 232"></animateMotion>
      </circle>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">
    Simplified RAG flow — retrieval first, then a grounded answer. Details anonymized.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
